[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12548.229, "timestamp": "03:29:08", "text": "嗯，好的。回来。是的。没关系"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12550.15, "timestamp": "03:29:10", "text": "无论我杀你多少次，你都不会屈服。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12551.389, "timestamp": "03:29:11", "text": "失去一颗心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12554.87, "timestamp": "03:29:14", "text": "哦，原来你是这样成神的。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12557.429, "timestamp": "03:29:17", "text": "上帝。不，我并不是这样成为神的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12559.75, "timestamp": "03:29:19", "text": "这就是我喜欢它的原因之一。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12562.95, "timestamp": "03:29:22", "text": "我的其中之一。该死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12576.51, "timestamp": "03:29:36", "text": "这。什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12581.03, "timestamp": "03:29:41", "text": "什么？你拥有多少颗心？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12588.14, "timestamp": "03:29:48", "text": "世界？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12589.55, "timestamp": "03:29:49", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12593.91, "timestamp": "03:29:53", "text": "哇。等待。所以如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12597.469, "timestamp": "03:29:57", "text": "吃金苹果。好的。"}]